WEBVTT

00:00:28.649 --> 00:00:30.276
(Laughter)

00:00:30.318 --> 00:00:31.819
It was a mile away.

00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:34.072
As we go, he says,

00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:35.740
"Why are you limping?"

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.784
I tell him I have something in my shoe.

00:00:38.743 --> 00:00:41.037
The movie was spectacular.

00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:43.581
It told the story of some
of soccer's greatest stars,

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:45.374
great Brazilian players.

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.626
I was ecstatic.

00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:50.004
At the end of the movie,
I told my dad about the foot;

00:00:50.046 --> 00:00:52.507
he took me to see an orthopedic doctor,

00:00:52.507 --> 00:00:54.717
who put my foot in a cast for three weeks.

00:00:56.052 --> 00:00:59.931
I tell you the story today,
because four decades later,

00:00:59.972 --> 00:01:03.351
I don't really consider myself
a soccer fan anymore.